The deepest lesson

These 20 people represent different layers of the AI revolution:

Layer	Key people
🧮 Mathematical foundations	Turing, Vapnik, Pearl
🧠 Birth of AI	McCarthy, Minsky
🔄 Neural networks	Hinton, LeCun, Bengio
📊 Data	Fei-Fei Li
🎮 Reinforcement learning	Sutton, Silver
🧬 Scientific AI	Hassabis
🤖 Generative AI	Goodfellow, Sutskever
⚡ Transformer	Vaswani
💻 Computing infrastructure	Jeff Dean, Jensen Huang
🌎 Mass adoption	Sam Altman
And there is a beautiful progression:

Turing asked the question.
McCarthy named the field.
Minsky built its early intellectual framework.
Vapnik and Pearl gave it mathematical reasoning.
Hinton, LeCun and Bengio revived neural networks.
Fei-Fei Li supplied the data.
Huang supplied the computational horsepower.
Sutton and Silver taught machines to act.
Vaswani supplied the Transformer.
Sutskever and others scaled it into LLMs.
Hassabis pushed AI into science.
Altman helped put it into everyone's hands.

That is, in a nutshell, the human story behind modern AI.
